# Phase 7 — proof-of-delivery files (server/lib/storage.js). Local disk
# only; never committed. Product photos are the exception: they are part
# of the shop, kept under readable names in uploads/products/ and tracked,
# so every machine has them after a pull (scripts/sync-product-images.mjs).
